<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were moderately active. Both classes traded steady.</p>
<p>Steers - part load choice 3 Blacks near 1400 lbs 68.50. High select and choice 2-3 1200-1400 lbs 66.00-67.50. Select and choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 64.00-66.00. Select 1-2 61.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - high select and choice 2-3 1025-1200 lbs 65.50-67.00. Select and choice 2-3 1000-1125 lbs 63.50-65.50.</p>
<p>Select 1-2 61.00-63.50.</p>
</text>
